えないで頂ければ服装・髪型改変等自由にしていただいて大丈夫です。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shinmei_keisho/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c892b21/uploads/origins/527165e7-caa6-4765-81d5-457d3fd1bf84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15c42dce17488afb6910010409eba374", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c892b21/uploads/origins/527165e7-caa6-4765-81d5-457d3fd1bf84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15c42dce17488afb6910010409eba374, https://si.imgix.net/9c892b21/uploads/origins/527165e7-caa6-4765-81d5-457d3fd1bf84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1d6d4df16171722e00ab5aaadadb7a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c892b21/uploads/origins/527165e7-caa6-4765-81d5-457d3fd1bf84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d188755d330cc6339a0858c537bb4093 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ポートフォリオ？とかにでもなんにでも使ってくれ！\nぱっつん女たちを4人ふわふわ髪1人癖毛ウルフ1人描いてください", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}